"der Anbieter nachzieht. Ob er das tut, hängt am Anbieter, nicht am Point-"
"Release von Ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"These programs stay installed but get no more updates until the vendor "
"catches up. Whether that happens is up to the vendor, not to Ubuntu's point "
"release."

#: dynotiq.py:3874
